# Cloudflare Pages rules. deploy/pages.py copies this into the build output with 404.html.
# No rules for the app's routes: Pages applies a 200 rule before it looks for a file, so a rule
# would hide the page deploy/pages.py writes for each route (deputados/2105.html, with that
# route's head for link previews). Each route is its own file and answers 200. Any other path
# with no file gets 404.html (also the app, which shows its "page not found" view) and status 404
# (#113).
#
# The only rules move pages that no longer exist. The coalition pages were one per short name
# until #111 made them one per list and run: AD and Madeira Primeiro go to their latest list.
/coligacoes/AD /coligacoes/ad-2024 301
/coligacoes/ad /coligacoes/ad-2024 301
/coligacoes/Madeira%20Primeiro /coligacoes/madeira-primeiro-2024 301
/coligacoes/madeira-primeiro /coligacoes/madeira-primeiro-2024 301
